OL,3,AFormer DUP leader Jeffrey Donaldson
OL,4,Asentenced to 15 years in prison for
OL,5,Achild sex abuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe judge says the ex-MP's offences
OL,8,Fhave led to a "catastrophic descent
OL,9,Finto disgrace". He was stripped of his
OL,10,Fknighthood in July
OL,12,FThe DUP - which Donaldson led from 2021
OL,13,Fto 2024 - says: "He deserves every day
OL,14,Fof the lengthy prison sentence"
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
